flowchart TD
 Answer["answer commit: waiting"] --> Claim["markSending: no second body send"]
 Claim --> Open["call_open(member_system = route.system or default, member_name = route.channel_id)"]
 Open -->|guaranteed unopened directory_link_down| Retry["30 seconds / answer + 10-minute bound"]
 Retry --> Claim
 Open -->|rejected / no session| Failed["reportDelivery failed -> unknown shown"]
 Open -->|session known| Checkpoint["DB: session_id before call_send"]
 Checkpoint --> Send["call_send once, reply_required=false"]
 Send -->|accepted: queued / delivered / stored| Handed["transaction: journal delivered + seq; reportDelivery delivered (handed to Bridge)"]
 Send -->|explicit delivery error| Failed
 Send -->|response lost| Unknown["journal unknown; reportDelivery unknown; never resend body"]
 Handed --> Open2["call stays open; no call_info polling, no call_hangup"]
 Open2 --> BridgeOwns["Bridge owns wake + recipient delivery + courier recovery"]
 Restart["process restart"] -->|legacy pending journal with seq| Handed
 Restart -->|legacy pending journal without seq| Unknown
 Restart -->|old sending without session| Unknown
 Get["explicit get / fetched"] --> Preserve["reportDelivery never overwrites fetched"]
 Handed --> UI["delivered = Bridge accepted the handoff; not proof the AI ran"]
